2.2 Market Engagement and Design Thinking
Entrepreneurs must engage with the market on a continual basis in order to iden-
tify and validate opportunities. Market research is the process of gathering infor-
mation that can be used to refine an opportunity and to plot and execute upon a
strategy. This information is critical to the new venture team; without it, a new
venture may launch a product only to find out that the customer does not value it.
